WEBVTT

00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:07.420
Amamiya is back home due to 
misfortune in his family.

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:10.530
Asahina is exhausted after turning the owl 
into a Mythic Beast Knight.

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:12.310
Today, we'll have to fight without those two.

00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:14.360
Do you have your eighth ready?

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:17.070
I think I can pull it off.

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:18.870
<b>Episode 19: Maimakterion and the Beast Knights</b>

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:18.250
Good.

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:19.790
Hakudou, Akane.

00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:23.500
Even though we have all three Mythic 
Beast Knights, don't let your guard down.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.750
The eleventh is stronger than 
anything we've faced so far.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:29.840
Don't let your guard down, 
no matter what it transforms into!

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:30.800
Right!

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:39.450
Whoa!

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.300
Wh-What is that thing?!

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:43.100
Th-That's...!

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:45.290
He's an old tokusatsu hero!

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:47.290
Pet Superhero Parrotman!

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:48.690
Let's go!

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:50.610
Invincible!

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:52.820
Hresvelgr!

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.720
Unicorn!

00:00:57.660 --> 00:00:59.530
Hmm...

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:02.330
The three Mythic Beast Knights, huh?

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:04.060
They're a magnificent sight together.

00:01:04.370 --> 00:01:06.860
Did you watch the reruns or something?

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:11.590
Back in the day, I played one 
of the monsters of the week.

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:15.870
They told me to go seriously 
to give it impact

00:01:15.870 --> 00:01:18.550
and I defeated Parrotman in 20 seconds.

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:21.640
I wonder how it'll go with you, Eleventh?

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:25.220
Sorry everyone,

00:01:25.220 --> 00:01:27.390
let me fight it alone for 20 seconds.

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:29.860
Drill Kick!

00:01:40.190 --> 00:01:41.490
<i>Oh, no! My footing!</i>

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:48.040
Unbreakable Shield!

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:50.130
Your 20 seconds are up, Nagumo-san!

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:51.960
No fair, Sou-chan!

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:52.760
Mikazuki!

00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:54.750
Let me join in!

00:01:58.140 --> 00:02:00.890
Ow, it's hard!

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:03.570
Thousand-Tailed Dragon!

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:05.050
Well?!

00:02:09.720 --> 00:02:12.440
Chaos Field: Space-Time Ebb.

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:17.240
Oh?

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:20.530
You restored our stamina?

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:25.400
I never expected becoming a Mythic 
Beast Knight would smooth out your power.

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:28.870
It strains my nerves even more 
though, so it's exhausting.

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:37.230
<i>I doubt I'll deal much damage 
even if I go all out again...</i>

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:38.800
<i>What do we do?</i>

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:48.770
Don't miss, Fruhling.

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:52.380
Don't stop.

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:54.230
Keep firing while you reload.

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:05.700
Did you get it?!

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:06.750
No.

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:09.580
It... It's crazy.

00:03:16.890 --> 00:03:18.090
A child?

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:20.050
Maimakterion.

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:22.670
The fragments are Shimaki's eighth?!

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:24.260
It got destroyed?!

00:03:24.740 --> 00:03:26.180
Weak!

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:28.720
Are you underestimating me, golem-user?!

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:31.030
I'll wait ten days.

00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:36.730
If you bring another shoddy golem, 
then I'll be abandoning the battlefield,

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:43.620
and I'll go kill every one 
of your friends and family!

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:50.580
Got it? Ten days!

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.620
Don't let him get to you.

00:03:59.620 --> 00:04:02.880
We were always fighting 
with many lives on the line.

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:06.250
Ten days from now, 
we'll make sure to defeat him.

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:08.140
Dismissed.

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:09.940
Everyone, do what you can.

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:28.510
<i>When I looked up, 
that sky was full of wonders.</i>

00:04:28.510 --> 00:04:33.810
<i>The despair I bottled up tormented me,</i>

00:04:33.810 --> 00:04:37.670
<i>and I wanted the courage 
to break my chains of isolation.</i>

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:39.040
<i>(You are my light)</i>

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:44.640
<i>I was searching for your 
brilliant light in my hazy dreams</i>

00:04:44.640 --> 00:04:48.940
<i>to kick away the limits placed on myself.</i>

00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:53.900
<i>Now with your courage, 
let’s soar into the sky.</i>

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:56.530
<i>Let's CRUSH the fear!</i>

00:04:56.530 --> 00:05:01.610
<i>I swear to you, at the ends 
of this chaotic world,</i>

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:04.360
<i>that even if you fall, I'll</i>

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:06.720
<i>Be the HERO!</i>

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:11.900
<i>I'll be waiting at the future 
we're moving toward,</i>

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:15.850
<i>with a “YES, MY LORD!” 
for your constant radiance,</i>

00:05:15.850 --> 00:05:19.860
<i>clutching the stars raining down upon us.</i>

00:05:19.860 --> 00:05:27.600
<i>I'll love you until we reach 
that future you want to destroy.</i>

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:43.940
Hmm...

00:05:44.630 --> 00:05:46.480
Golems...

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:47.910
Hyou-kun...

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:53.870
Nine more days...

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:58.110
Akane's power lets us attack 
all-out multiple times,

00:05:58.110 --> 00:06:00.080
but with the strength of its armor...

00:06:01.310 --> 00:06:06.210
I can't believe they had a battle here 
while you were back home.

00:06:06.210 --> 00:06:09.390
I wanted to see Shimaki-dono's eighth.

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:12.850
Hm? Mm, yeah.

00:06:13.170 --> 00:06:14.710
Get your head straight.

00:06:14.710 --> 00:06:19.060
They told us the final fight 
against the eleventh is in eight days.

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:20.920
I know.

00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:23.640
Looks like I'll be able to use my 
new technique in actual combat, too.

00:06:23.640 --> 00:06:24.780
Though, more importantly...

00:06:25.430 --> 00:06:28.860
If I could see the Biscuit 
Hammer from there,

00:06:29.710 --> 00:06:32.990
that means it's not 
on the Hammer or on Earth.

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:35.730
Ah!

00:06:35.730 --> 00:06:36.830
What is it?

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:39.290
Hey, Yuuhi?

00:06:40.490 --> 00:06:43.150
Wh-What is that?

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:47.670
So what's this you want to test out?

00:06:48.020 --> 00:06:50.100
I don't know if we can do it or not,

00:06:50.100 --> 00:06:52.750
but I thought it would be worth trying.

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:54.640
It's really just an idea, though.

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:56.950
So what are we doing?

00:06:56.950 --> 00:06:58.980
Um, uh...

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:00.600
Subaru-chan, go on.

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:09.760
P-Please...

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:11.610
hold my hand.

00:07:11.940 --> 00:07:12.720
Sure.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:14.700
I'll take this one.

00:07:17.010 --> 00:07:19.500
Hey, are you saying your idea is...?

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:20.570
Yes.

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:23.020
Seriously? You can do that?

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:25.670
We're about to find out now.

00:07:28.480 --> 00:07:32.060
I've been developing 
and researching this technique

00:07:32.060 --> 00:07:34.380
with the idea of defeating 
the twelfth in mind.

00:07:34.380 --> 00:07:37.500
This isn't a half-baked plan 
to defeat the eleventh.

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:41.000
It's to help us gain true power 
and victory through the end.

00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:43.230
<i>This...</i>

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:46.480
<i>isn't just a righteous battle 
to defend the Earth,</i>

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:50.000
<i>it's a battle to protect our lives.</i>

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:52.990
<i>There are people I want to protect.</i>

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:55.950
<i>So I'll start with us three.</i>

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:57.880
Here we go, Yuki.

00:07:57.880 --> 00:07:58.620
Yeah.

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:00.240
Here we go, Shinonome-san.

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:01.330
All right.

00:08:02.390 --> 00:08:04.520
Mmm! This is good!

00:08:04.520 --> 00:08:06.630
What's the secret to the flavor?

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:09.220
Secret?

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:12.550
Uh, I just put in what feels right.

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:16.520
Did someone teach you how to cook?

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:21.300
No, I learned it by myself, so I'm 
not good at teaching others, either.

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:24.390
Sorry, especially since you came out here.

00:08:24.390 --> 00:08:27.910
No, I'm sorry for eating all your food.

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:30.890
It's really good.

00:08:30.890 --> 00:08:31.990
Thank you.

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:37.230
Have you thought up any 
strategies for the eleventh?

00:08:37.230 --> 00:08:42.300
I was thinking I could 
wrap it up and restrain it.

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:43.570
What about you?

00:08:43.570 --> 00:08:45.160
I figure I can use fire, too,

00:08:45.160 --> 00:08:47.380
since it's the same manipulation of heat.

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:50.770
Kusakabe-kun's technique, huh?

00:08:50.770 --> 00:08:51.560
Yes.

00:08:51.560 --> 00:08:54.540
Raging God will only serve 
as a diversion, though.

00:08:54.540 --> 00:08:56.870
Restraint and diversion, huh?

00:08:56.870 --> 00:08:59.100
So the key to this fight will be...

00:08:59.690 --> 00:09:01.810
Shimaki-san, right?

00:09:02.110 --> 00:09:06.570
For now, I suppose you should practice 
your capturing and restraining, huh?

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:08.190
On someone fast.

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:10.350
For example, Amamiya-san?

00:09:10.350 --> 00:09:13.150
Practice capturing Amamiya-kun?

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:15.460
Oh, wait up!

00:09:15.460 --> 00:09:17.410
Come on, catch me if you can!

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:23.080
No, you're not capturing Amamiya-san,

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:26.390
you're using him to practice 
capturing the eleventh.

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:27.780
R-Right!

00:09:27.780 --> 00:09:29.420
The eleventh!

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:32.380
Hakudou-san, do you have a crush on...?

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:34.840
Uh, well, that's...

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:36.270
You shouldn't hide it.

00:09:36.270 --> 00:09:37.810
Just go capture him, you know?

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:39.520
C-Capture him?

00:09:39.520 --> 00:09:40.840
For practice, practice.

00:09:40.840 --> 00:09:41.940
H-Hana-chan!

00:09:41.940 --> 00:09:45.490
There's no time to waste being bashful.

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:46.810
No, I'm not being bashful, um...

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:46.810
<i>They're getting excited.</i>

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:53.940
Sorry for calling you here out of the blue.

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:57.840
No, combat training will 
do us both some good.

00:09:57.840 --> 00:10:00.280
There's something I wanted to 
practice, too, anyway.

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:02.660
Then here I go!

00:10:03.190 --> 00:10:05.500
<i>Capture means both seizing and binding...</i>

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:06.620
Go ahead.

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:09.030
<i>I wonder how well Babylon's 
movement enhancement</i>

00:10:09.030 --> 00:10:12.090
<i>will let me slip through a 
Mythic Beast Knight's powerful attacks.</i>

00:10:25.530 --> 00:10:26.520
<i>I can dodge it!</i>

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:30.690
Oh!

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:33.190
His body's keeping up with his eyes!

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:37.280
Then he's seeing if he can 
slip into close range!

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:39.700
<i>He's heading towards me?!</i>

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:44.260
So this is the mobility 
of Amamiya-kun's new technique?

00:10:44.260 --> 00:10:45.660
H-He's fast!

00:10:46.260 --> 00:10:49.540
The one to destroy this Earth will be me.

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:51.610
<i>I-I have to stop him!</i>

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:56.480
Yako, way to go!

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:59.220
I-I did it!

00:11:00.310 --> 00:11:03.230
Being held upside down is scary! Scary!

00:11:04.170 --> 00:11:07.060
Now do you realize how frightening it is?

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:10.980
One more round, please.

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:12.460
Please.

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:23.810
I-I think we should call it for today.

00:11:23.810 --> 00:11:26.180
<i>Why is this so much fun?!</i>

00:11:26.180 --> 00:11:28.580
<i>It feels like landing a big whopper!</i>

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:31.960
G-Good work today.

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:36.550
<i>Being held upside down in the air 
by someone else is really scary.</i>

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:38.060
Well, I'll be going home.

00:11:38.060 --> 00:11:41.360
Um, Amamiya-kun, are you free after this?

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:42.010
Huh?

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:44.340
Uh, um...

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:46.810
You can land a man through his stomach!

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:50.260
Why don't you try serving some 
homemade food after your training?

00:11:51.420 --> 00:11:55.330
I want to treat you to dinner to thank you 
for going along with me today.

00:11:55.840 --> 00:11:57.320
So, come to my place?

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:57.940
Huh?

00:11:57.940 --> 00:11:58.780
Come on.

00:12:00.160 --> 00:12:01.030
S-Sure.

00:12:03.310 --> 00:12:04.360
Well?

00:12:04.360 --> 00:12:06.320
I-It's good.

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:21.380
Th-Thank you for the food.

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:24.670
I wouldn't want to overstay my welcome,

00:12:24.670 --> 00:12:26.140
so I'll be going...

00:12:26.690 --> 00:12:28.050
Thank you very much.

00:12:28.050 --> 00:12:31.350
R-Really? I could serve some tea?

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:34.810
<i>I-I can't capture him at all!</i>

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:37.160
You could just spend the night.

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:40.830
Though, Amami,

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:43.150
how long are you planning 
to let this drag out?

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:46.150
What do you mean?

00:12:46.150 --> 00:12:48.680
I'm talking about Yako's 
confession that night.

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:50.850
You actually heard her then, didn't you?

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:53.280
Amamiya-kun.

00:12:53.280 --> 00:12:54.770
I love you.

00:12:55.110 --> 00:12:57.250
So I'll st—

00:12:59.180 --> 00:13:00.790
I heard her, Sia.

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:03.220
But I didn't hear the end.

00:13:03.870 --> 00:13:05.040
Hakudou-san,

00:13:05.040 --> 00:13:09.180
what came after "So I'll"?

00:13:12.340 --> 00:13:14.640
Stop. It was stop.

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:17.100
Stop what?

00:13:18.180 --> 00:13:22.570
You and the Princess are trying 
to destroy Earth, right?

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:25.700
You knew?

00:13:26.130 --> 00:13:27.380
Even so...

00:13:27.380 --> 00:13:30.180
That's after our final 
battle against Animus.

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:34.580
Why don't we stay friends until then?

00:13:35.270 --> 00:13:37.230
Yeah, that's fine.

00:13:37.230 --> 00:13:39.040
Can I make one request, too?

00:13:39.930 --> 00:13:41.000
What's that?

00:13:41.540 --> 00:13:45.820
If I win and stop you two at the very end,

00:13:46.310 --> 00:13:47.970
then go out with me.

00:13:54.320 --> 00:13:57.570
I-I'll think about it.

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:02.870
I read it.

00:14:02.870 --> 00:14:03.870
Have it back.

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:05.280
<b>The Furious Ocean,
a Biography</b>

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:09.030
Taiyou, what are humans?

00:14:09.760 --> 00:14:14.860
Smart animals that evolved from monkeys.

00:14:14.860 --> 00:14:16.200
Is that all?

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:19.620
Hmm... I don't know.

00:14:20.820 --> 00:14:22.840
What are golems?

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:25.050
Animus' servants?

00:14:25.730 --> 00:14:26.940
Right.

00:14:26.940 --> 00:14:30.750
We're warriors created 
through Animus' super powers.

00:14:31.570 --> 00:14:33.330
I'm a golem.

00:14:33.980 --> 00:14:35.760
You're a human.

00:14:35.760 --> 00:14:37.100
Yeah.

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:38.500
Is that all?

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:40.850
No, there's other stuff.

00:14:41.460 --> 00:14:42.480
Other stuff?

00:14:43.220 --> 00:14:48.320
Names, titles, shapes...

00:14:49.870 --> 00:14:52.490
What makes you you?

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:54.740
It doesn't matter.

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:55.950
What?

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:58.450
Kuh, I got it.

00:14:58.450 --> 00:15:01.680
After thinking about the eleventh, I got it.

00:15:01.680 --> 00:15:03.560
Got what?

00:15:03.560 --> 00:15:06.630
What is the self?

00:15:07.230 --> 00:15:08.840
It doesn't matter.

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:10.590
It never mattered.

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:18.690
Asahina, how are you?

00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:20.830
Invincible!

00:15:22.240 --> 00:15:23.980
It's unusual...

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:26.580
for us to meet outside the battlefield.

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:29.110
Are you sure you don't need 
to be inside that girl?

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:31.820
Just shut up and watch them.

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:33.990
Sou-chan, I've got a new move.

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:35.030
We'll take the lead!

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:35.990
All right!

00:15:37.210 --> 00:15:39.290
Here we go! Let the battle begin!

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:41.290
Bring it, you humans!

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:43.830
Destruction Domain - Burning Army!

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:47.400
A combination field?!

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:48.760
You can use it like that?!

00:15:56.930 --> 00:15:58.070
The ninth?!

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:00.020
Raging God!

00:16:08.700 --> 00:16:10.240
Four-legged capoeira?!

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:12.320
All right, I caught it!

00:16:25.510 --> 00:16:26.580
Are you okay?

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:28.630
Yes. Thanks.

00:16:29.430 --> 00:16:32.320
<i>Just now, it looked at me.</i>

00:16:32.320 --> 00:16:33.470
<i>At </i>me<i>.</i>

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:38.220
The Biscuit Hammer?!

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:45.690
The sky is my domain.

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:48.510
The only one allowed to fly higher 
than me is my Lucifer.

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:51.150
Nice pass!

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:53.090
Heave ho!

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:02.540
It really is tough.

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:08.530
The Beast Knights' strength is insignificant.

00:17:08.530 --> 00:17:13.180
I've confirmed I can leave anytime 
and kill everyone you all know.

00:17:13.660 --> 00:17:16.800
Now, it's time to take action, golem-user.

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:19.260
Can I ask something before that?

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:24.100
What have you been doing these 
past ten days since we last fought?

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:26.290
What is he asking?

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:28.060
I read books in the mountains.

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:29.690
Was that all?

00:17:30.850 --> 00:17:32.780
Then why give us ten whole days?

00:17:33.690 --> 00:17:34.840
What is he—

00:17:34.840 --> 00:17:35.740
Does he mean—

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:39.330
Are you sure you weren't 
healing away the damage you hid

00:17:39.330 --> 00:17:41.510
with your transformation ability?

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:43.950
Just like every other golem?

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:47.560
Go ahead and try it.

00:17:47.560 --> 00:17:49.880
See if your attacks will work on me.

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:51.730
I shall.

00:17:53.390 --> 00:17:56.300
Creation Field: Kybele!

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:03.600
Three at once?!

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:05.310
Whoa! Awesome!

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:07.270
They're nothing like before!

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:11.680
I figured it out thanks 
to you, Maimakterion.

00:18:11.680 --> 00:18:13.540
What are these powers?

00:18:13.540 --> 00:18:15.780
What are golems?

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:17.440
This is the essence of that.

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:20.670
Yeah, this is it.

00:18:20.670 --> 00:18:24.480
I want to express this emotion!

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:32.200
Everyone, back away!

00:18:32.200 --> 00:18:34.180
Use this time to recover your stamina!

00:18:34.180 --> 00:18:36.170
There won't be any need for that.

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:06.590
I-I truly felt like I was fighting.

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:10.000
We both exerted all of our strength.

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:13.230
But am I going to die here?

00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:14.600
Die?

00:19:14.600 --> 00:19:17.230
Are golems even able to die?

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:19.570
Shimaki Hyou!

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:22.620
What are golems?!

00:19:22.620 --> 00:19:24.400
What am I?!

00:19:24.400 --> 00:19:25.760
Me?!

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:28.470
Golems are a shield for everyone.

00:19:28.470 --> 00:19:30.080
Expendable pawns.

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:31.560
That's what I used to think.

00:19:32.630 --> 00:19:34.420
But I was wrong.

00:19:34.420 --> 00:19:37.010
They're a part of me.

00:19:37.010 --> 00:19:39.070
They're projections of what's inside me.

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:40.740
Reflections of my heart.

00:19:41.880 --> 00:19:44.040
That's what golems are,

00:19:44.040 --> 00:19:45.700
what this power is.

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:47.140
Heart?

00:19:47.940 --> 00:19:52.040
I realized it when I recalled 
your infinite transformations.

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:54.460
Their shape didn't matter.

00:19:55.070 --> 00:19:59.090
There was no need to make 
them resemble Animus' golems.

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:00.880
I was free.

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:03.090
Free?

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:05.900
The power to freely transform.

00:20:05.900 --> 00:20:07.400
Animus' heart.

00:20:08.080 --> 00:20:11.060
I think you were his artistic masterpiece.

00:20:11.750 --> 00:20:14.440
Artistic?

00:20:14.990 --> 00:20:16.900
Any lingering regrets?

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:19.380
Books...

00:20:21.630 --> 00:20:24.000
My books...

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:31.760
Farewell.

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:33.540
Farewell.

00:20:34.660 --> 00:20:35.920
<i>Farewell.</i>

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:55.520
Good work.

00:20:57.290 --> 00:21:01.200
The end... came in a flash...

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:03.820
even though we struggled in battle so long.

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:05.550
It was a double KO.

00:21:05.550 --> 00:21:07.470
It was incredible.

00:21:07.470 --> 00:21:11.450
Still, pulling out three at once 
was awesome, Hyou-chan!

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:14.230
He's done it to us, as well.

00:21:14.230 --> 00:21:17.170
The way I fought was a little immature,

00:21:18.030 --> 00:21:20.270
but now we both have only one left.

00:21:20.940 --> 00:21:25.360
Though we've garnered more than 
just our enemy's defeat in this battle.

00:21:25.890 --> 00:21:28.340
Hoshikawa, that combination field—

00:21:28.340 --> 00:21:29.210
Yes.

00:21:29.210 --> 00:21:31.910
Next time, I'd like to do it with all of us.

00:21:31.910 --> 00:21:34.540
Our goal is to defeat 
the twelfth in a single blow.

00:21:34.540 --> 00:21:35.200
Yeah.

00:21:35.200 --> 00:21:37.150
A single blow?

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:39.710
Is that really possible?

00:21:39.710 --> 00:21:42.110
Oh, but maybe...

00:21:42.110 --> 00:21:45.700
You all can see a path to victory now.

00:21:46.830 --> 00:21:48.070
Yuu-kun?

00:21:48.890 --> 00:21:51.030
That means you might be able to see it now.

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:52.990
What do you mean, Amamiya?

00:21:53.450 --> 00:21:54.450
Look at the sky.

00:21:54.900 --> 00:21:55.990
The sky?

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:01.880
Is despair really the only thing 
hanging in that sky?

00:22:02.260 --> 00:22:04.420
As you are now, you all should see it.

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:05.790
I'm sure you can now.

00:22:06.730 --> 00:22:08.960
What is that shadow?!

00:22:16.020 --> 00:22:17.520
Can you see it?

00:22:17.520 --> 00:22:21.570
That's the Counter Celestial Weapon 
to use against the Biscuit Hammer.

00:22:21.980 --> 00:22:24.350
Blues Drive Monster.

00:22:25.160 --> 00:22:31.830
I've been waiting a long time for those 
who can see hope alongside visible despair.

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:11.970
<b>Next Episode:
Anima and Animus</b>
